---
// Lays out a row of <Cutout> components side-by-side. Wrap multiple Cutouts
// in this when they're direct children of a slide section — the section uses
// CSS grid for layout, which would otherwise stack each Cutout on its own
// row. Inside <li> or other block-level parents, Cutouts already flow
// naturally and this wrapper is unnecessary.
---

<div class="cutout-row"><slot /></div>
